{
  "name": "personal-cloud-drive",
  "version": "1.3.20",
  "changelog": [
    "升级 AI 对话抽屉顶栏为「全元素保留式」自适应排布：空间变窄或出现返回/切全库按钮时，不再隐藏「📁 全部文件」或模型胶囊，而是自动优雅换位至次行整齐排列，任意宽度下功能完整、零遮挡零溢出",
    "加固网盘全局多分辨率自适应防溢出策略：窄抽屉下上下文条按钮与提示词卡片自动换行适配，顶栏面包屑、搜索栏与全站弹窗在任意窗口大小下均零横向/纵向溢出"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "description": "DPSir 个人私有智云盘 (Personal Cloud Drive) - 核心服务与依赖配置",
  "main": "server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js",
    "start:watchdog": "node scripts/server-watchdog.js",
    "test:smoke": "node tests/smoke.js",
    "test:isolation": "node tests/test_avatar_isolation.js",
    "test:security": "node tests/test_password_and_recovery.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "archiver": "^7.0.1",
    "compression": "^1.8.1",
    "dompurify": "^3.1.6",
    "express": "^4.19.2",
    "fast-xml-parser": "^5.9.3",
    "jszip": "^3.10.1",
    "katex": "^0.16.11",
    "mammoth": "^1.12.0",
    "marked": "^12.0.2",
    "multer": "^2.2.0",
    "pdf-parse": "^1.1.1",
    "tesseract.js": "^5.1.1",
    "xlsx": "^0.18.5"
  }
}